# Walkthrough: Indian Tourism App

The application has been successfully started on port 3001.

## Actions Taken
- **Port Handling:** Port 3000 was in use, so the server was started on port 3001 using `npm run dev -- -p 3001`.
- **Verification:** The application was verified in the browser. The landing page, including hero sections and interactive elements, loaded correctly.

