## Project Overview

### Cleanup Results
Successfully removed the following non-essential files to streamline the codebase:
- [BUILD_COMPLETE.md](file:///c:/Users/GOVIND%20NAIK/OneDrive/Desktop/indian-tourism-app/BUILD_COMPLETE.md): Legacy build log.
- `public/*.svg`: Boilerplate Next.js icons.

### Technology Stack
- **Core Framework:** [Next.js](https://nextjs.org/) (Version 16.1.6)
- **Programming Language:** [TypeScript](https://www.typescriptlang.org/) ([.ts](file:///c:/Users/GOVIND%20NAIK/OneDrive/Desktop/indian-tourism-app/next-env.d.ts), [.tsx](file:///c:/Users/GOVIND%20NAIK/OneDrive/Desktop/indian-tourism-app/src/app/page.tsx))
- **Styling:** [Tailwind CSS](https://tailwindcss.com/)
- **Animations:** [Framer Motion](https://www.framer.com/motion/)
- **3D Graphics:** [Three.js](https://threejs.org/) (via `@react-three/fiber` and `@react-three/drei`) & [Spline](https://spline.design/)
- **State Management:** [Zustand](https://github.com/pmndrs/zustand)
- **Database:** [MongoDB](https://www.mongodb.com/) (via `mongoose`)

### Directory Structure
- `src/app/`: Modern Next.js App Router folders defining pages and APIs.
- `src/components/`: Reusable React components (UI elements, 3D scenes, layout).
- `src/data/`: Static data files (e.g., `destinations.ts` for mood and travel info).
- `src/lib/`: Shared utility functions and library initializations.
- `src/models/`: Database schema definitions for MongoDB.
- `src/store/`: Client-side state managed via Zustand.
- `public/`: Static assets like images and fonts.

The application continues to run on `http://localhost:3001`.

